menu "Watch OS services"

    config WATCH_ECOS_PAIRING
        bool "ECOS experimental pairing (ESP-NOW or LAN)"
        default y
        help
            Explicit three-minute pairing window, device to device over ESP-NOW
            (no router) or over the home Wi-Fi when an IP is given. No idle
            task or listener; pairwise credentials only, without HID access.
            Disable to omit the service, watch page and dashboard controls.

    config WATCH_VOICE_MEMOS
        bool "Experimental local voice memos"
        default n
        help
            Enable only while validating microphone capture, playback and alarm
            handover on supported hardware. Disabled in production by default.


    config WATCH_UPDATE_MANIFEST_URL
        string "Online update: default manifest URL"
        default ""
        help
            JSON manifest checked by Settings > Aggiornamento when the user did
            not set an address: {"version": "1.2.0", "url": "https://.../x.bin"}.
            Each firmware project sets its own in sdkconfig.defaults (the CI
            publishes it, see .github/workflows/release.yml).

endmenu
